# ============================================================
# Likelink — Netlify redirects / SPA fallback
# ------------------------------------------------------------
# Static files (robots.txt, sitemap.xml, manifest.json, icons/*, /.well-known/*)
# take precedence over the SPA fallback on Netlify, so they are always served
# literally. The rules below are defensive fallbacks only.
# ============================================================

# Site-verification / security metadata must never be rewritten to the SPA shell.
/.well-known/*   /.well-known/:splat   200

# Classic SPA fallback: every other route returns the app shell (index.html).
/*               /index.html            200
